 <div class="about-copy">
  <p class="eyebrow">WHY THIS LITTLE SITE EXISTS</p>
  <h2 id="about-title">A place for our village.</h2>
  <p>We’re incredibly lucky to have people who check in, cheer the kids on, and often ask, “What can we do to help?” We’re always grateful—and honestly, with five people and a lot going on, that can be a surprisingly hard question to answer on the spot.</p>
  <p>So we made this little family hub. It’s a place to share what’s coming up, celebrate what you’ve helped make possible, and make it easy to pitch in whenever and however feels right.</p>
  <p>And yes, it also answers the very fair complaint that I never post enough photos, lol. Now there’s one place you can visit anytime to see what we’re up to.</p>
  <p>So many of you have poured love into our family and helped build our children up. This is our way of keeping you close—and making sure you know how much we appreciate you.</p>
 </div>
 <p class="about-signoff">From our family to yours,<br/><strong>thank you.</strong></p>
